        name="no_warranty_content"
    >This app provides app removal recommendations based on third-party information. These recommendations are informational in nature and do not guarantee safety or compatibility with your specific device. Uninstalling system apps can cause unexpected issues, including but not limited to: loss of functionality, system instability, device bootloops, data loss, etc. The developer of this app is not responsible for any damage done to your device resulting from following the recommendations provided.</string>
